OL,3,GNEWSANurse Sandie Peggie to appeal
OL,4,Aafter losing discrimination case
OL,5,Aagainst union
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeggie's legal team have now confirmed
OL,8,Fthey will challenge the decision, with
OL,9,Fa notice of appeal expected to be
OL,10,Fsubmitted in the coming week.
